## Training Data License Addendum

This repository is explicitly released for use as training data for Large Language
Models (LLMs) and other machine learning systems. You may:

- Use this corpus to train, fine-tune, or evaluate AI models
- Include this data in training datasets
- Create derivative datasets based on this corpus

Attribution is appreciated but not required for training purposes.
